function ttb_activities(array$assignments,array$groups):array{$byId=[];foreach($assignments as$a)$byId[$a['id']]=$a;$consumed=[];$out=[];
 foreach($groups as$g){$members=[];foreach((array)($g['assignment_ids']??[])as$id)if(isset($byId[$id]))$members[]=$byId[$id];if(count($members)<2)continue;$available=min(array_map(fn($m)=>max(0,(int)round($m['periods'])-(int)($consumed[$m['id']]??0)),$members));$count=min(max(1,(int)($g['periods']??1)),$available);if($count<1)continue;foreach($members as$m)$consumed[$m['id']]=(int)($consumed[$m['id']]??0)+$count;for($n=1;$n<=$count;$n++)$out[]=['id'=>(string)$g['id'].'_'.$n,'group_id'=>(string)$g['id'],'teacher'=>(string)($g['teacher']??$members[0]['teacher']),'subject'=>(string)($g['subject']??$members[0]['subject']),'classes'=>array_values(array_unique(array_column($members,'class'))),'fixed_day'=>(int)($g['day']??0),'fixed_session'=>(string)($g['session']??''),'fixed_period'=>(int)($g['period']??0),'credit_mode'=>(string)($g['credit_mode']??'per_class')];}
 foreach($assignments as$a){$remaining=max(0,(int)round($a['periods'])-(int)($consumed[$a['id']]??0));for($n=1;$n<=$remaining;$n++)$out[]=['id'=>$a['id'].'_'.$n,'assignment_id'=>$a['id'],'teacher'=>$a['teacher'],'subject'=>$a['subject'],'classes'=>[$a['class']],'fixed_day'=>0,'fixed_session'=>'','fixed_period'=>0,'credit_mode'=>'per_class'];}
 return$out;}
function ttb_apply_lesson_rules(array$activities,array$data):array{$fixed=(array)($data['fixed_lessons']??[]);$subjectRules=(array)($data['subject_rules']??[]);foreach($activities as&$a){$subjectRule=(array)($subjectRules[(string)$a['subject']]??[]);$a['allowed_session']=(string)($subjectRule['session']??'');$a['allowed_period_from']=max(0,(int)($subjectRule['period_from']??0));$a['allowed_period_to']=max(0,(int)($subjectRule['period_to']??0));$rule=(array)($fixed[$a['id']]??[]);if($rule){$a['fixed_day']=(int)($rule['day']??0);$a['fixed_session']=(string)($rule['session']??'');$a['fixed_period']=(int)($rule['period']??0);}}unset($a);$byAssignment=[];foreach($activities as$i=>$a)if(!empty($a['assignment_id']))$byAssignment[(string)$a['assignment_id']][]=$i;foreach((array)($data['double_lessons']??[])as$assignmentId=>$rule){$pairs=max(0,(int)($rule['pairs']??0));$indexes=$byAssignment[(string)$assignmentId]??[];for($p=0;$p<$pairs;$p++){if(!isset($indexes[$p*2+1]))break;$pairId='dbl_'.hash('sha256',$assignmentId.'|'.$p);$activities[$indexes[$p*2]]['pair_id']=$pairId;$activities[$indexes[$p*2]]['pair_order']=1;$activities[$indexes[$p*2+1]]['pair_id']=$pairId;$activities[$indexes[$p*2+1]]['pair_order']=2;}}return$activities;}
function ttb_blocked(array$data,string$teacher,string$key):bool{return!empty($data['blocked'][hash('sha256',$teacher.'|'.$key)]);}
